# BRAVADO: a tap of A shoots once the way Dice faces. Held, A keeps
# shooting and holds the aim: she can walk any way (strafe) and the shots
# still go the way she faced when she pressed it. Let go and the pad turns
# her again. Held fire comes every 14 frames.
game bravado
wait 5
cheat run 1
cheat empty
cheat nopools
expect p1_face == 6
press A
expect p1_fired == 1
expect pshots == 1
expect shot0_vy100 == -400
expect shot0_vx100 == 0
wait 30
# hold fire, then walk right: still aiming up
hold A
wait 3
hold RIGHT 30
expect p1_face == 6
expect p1_locked == 1
expect p1_x == 190
expect p1_fired >= 3
expect shot0_vx100 == 0
# let go, and the pad turns her
press RIGHT
expect p1_face == 0
expect p1_locked == 0
# A pressed together with a direction faces that way at once
wait 20
press DOWN A
expect p1_face == 2
expect shot0_vy100 == 400
# the rate of held fire: shots on frames 0, 14, 28, 42 and 56
cheat run 1
cheat empty
cheat nopools
hold A 57
expect p1_fired == 5
